@startuml phase15_transcription_providers
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title Phase 15.0: Transcription - Provider Agnostic

actor User
participant "SemanticCore" as Core
participant "ITranscriber\n(Interface)" as Interface

box "Gemini Provider" #LightBlue
    participant "GeminiAudioAnalyzer" as Gemini
    participant "Gemini API" as GeminiAPI
end box

box "Whisper Provider (Phase 15.1)" #LightGreen
    participant "WhisperTranscriber" as Whisper
    participant "Whisper Model" as WhisperModel
end box

== Scenario 1: Using Gemini Audio ==

User -> Core: create(transcriber=GeminiAudioAnalyzer())
activate Core
Core -> Gemini: set as transcriber
deactivate Core

User -> Core: transcribe_media("video.mp4")
activate Core

Core -> Interface: supported_formats?
Interface -> Gemini: supported_formats
Gemini --> Interface: ["mp3", "wav", "m4a"]
Interface --> Core: formats list

Core -> Interface: transcribe(audio_path, language="Russian")
activate Interface
Interface -> Gemini: transcribe(audio_path, "Russian")
activate Gemini

Gemini -> GeminiAPI: upload & analyze
activate GeminiAPI
GeminiAPI --> Gemini: {text, segments[]}
deactivate GeminiAPI

Gemini -> Gemini: parse to TranscriptionResult
Gemini --> Interface: TranscriptionResult
deactivate Gemini

Interface --> Core: TranscriptionResult
deactivate Interface

Core --> User: chunks with transcription
deactivate Core

== Scenario 2: Switching to Whisper (Phase 15.1) ==

User -> Core: create(transcriber=WhisperTranscriber(model="medium"))
note right
  **Same code structure,
  different provider!**
end note
activate Core
Core -> Whisper: set as transcriber
deactivate Core

User -> Core: transcribe_media("video.mp4")
activate Core

Core -> Interface: supported_formats?
Interface -> Whisper: supported_formats
Whisper --> Interface: ["mp3", "wav", "flac", "m4a"]
Interface --> Core: formats list

Core -> Interface: transcribe(audio_path, language="ru")
activate Interface
Interface -> Whisper: transcribe(audio_path, "ru")
activate Whisper

Whisper -> WhisperModel: load_model("medium")
activate WhisperModel
WhisperModel --> Whisper: model loaded
deactivate WhisperModel

Whisper -> WhisperModel: transcribe(audio, language="ru")
activate WhisperModel
note right
  **Local processing
  (no API calls)**
end note
WhisperModel --> Whisper: {text, segments[], language}
deactivate WhisperModel

Whisper -> Whisper: parse to TranscriptionResult
Whisper --> Interface: TranscriptionResult
deactivate Whisper

Interface --> Core: TranscriptionResult
deactivate Interface

Core --> User: chunks with transcription
deactivate Core

note over User, WhisperModel
  **Key Insight:**
  SemanticCore code is IDENTICAL
  for both Gemini and Whisper.
  
  ITranscriber interface hides
  all provider-specific details.
  
  Same TranscriptionResult DTO
  regardless of provider.
end note

== DTO Structure (Both Providers) ==

note over Interface
  **TranscriptionResult:**
  - full_text: str
  - segments: list[TranscriptionSegment]
  - language: str|None
  
  **TranscriptionSegment:**
  - text: str
  - start_time: float (seconds)
  - end_time: float (seconds)
end note

@enduml
